# Sharpening the Sword (sandoria 90, PLD AF1): Ailbeche in Northern San d'Oria, Sobane in Southern San d'Oria, the
# Stalagmite and Polevik in Ordelle's Caves. A PLD 40 with Father and Son completed: without the Family Counselor title
# not offered (Father and Son's OH_I_WANT_MY_ITEM); with it, a trade (no Sharpening trade handler; Father and Son's
# completed section: the title held, nil), 45 (option 0: Option 1), 43 (priority 200; option 0:
# nothing; option 1: Option 0, begun). Accepted without the whetstone: Ailbeche's 42, Sobane's 52, the Stalagmite
# (Polevik popped, noAction; with Polevik up DRY_WIND + 1 and DRY_WIND), Polevik's kill (Stage 1), the Stalagmite (the
# Ordelle Whetstone), the Stalagmite again (the whetstone held: no section, DRY_WIND). With it: Sobane's 52, Ailbeche's
# 44 (completed: Honor Sword, fame +20, the whetstone deleted). Ailbeche is not talked to after the completion: the
# completed section (check 4) is #completed's.
# Ailbeche's script answers A Boy's Dream / Under Oath vars only (none set). Sobane has no script (default
# SOBANE_DIALOG); Signed in Blood needs fame level 3 (fame 0 here). The Stalagmite has no script; its default is DRY_WIND.
lists NorthernSanDoria/Ailbeche/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/43 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/45 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/44 SouthernSanDoria/Sobane/onTrigger OrdellesCaves/Stalagmite/onTrigger OrdellesCaves/Polevik/onMobDeath
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=5.3,0.5,24.9 job=PLD lvl=40
quest Sandoria.FatherAndSon completed
item BoneChip
login
trigger Ailbeche                          # no title: not offered; Father and Son: OH_I_WANT_MY_ITEM, noAction
title FamilyCounselor
trade Ailbeche BoneChip x1                # available: Father and Son's trade, the title held: nil; his script: nothing
trigger Ailbeche                          # the title, PLD 40, Option 0: 45 (over Father and Son's AILBECHE_WHEN_FISHING)
finish                                    # option 0: Option 1
trigger Ailbeche                          # Option 1: 43 (priority 200)
finish                                    # option 0: nothing
trigger Ailbeche                          # 43
finish option=1                           # Option 0, begun
trigger Ailbeche                          # accepted, no whetstone: 42
finish
warp -189,-2.9,97.2 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Sobane                            # no whetstone: 52
finish
warp -49.4,-1.07,7.2 OrdellesCaves
trigger Stalagmite                        # Stage 0, Polevik down: popped and claimed, noAction
trigger Stalagmite                        # Polevik up: DRY_WIND + 1 (the whetstone) and DRY_WIND
kill POLEVIK                              # Stage 1
trigger Stalagmite                        # Stage 1: Stage 0, the key item Ordelle Whetstone
trigger Stalagmite                        # the whetstone held: no section; DRY_WIND
warp -189,-2.9,97.2 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Sobane                            # the whetstone: 52
finish
warp 5.3,0.5,24.9 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Ailbeche                          # the whetstone: 44
finish                                    # completed: Honor Sword, fame +20; the whetstone deleted
